    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Vidplex is a powerful and lightweight WordPress block plugin designed to display YouTube videos in a stylish and responsive gallery layout. Whether you&#8217;re a content creator, marketer, or blogger, this plugin makes it easy to showcase YouTube videos directly in your posts and pages using the Gutenberg editor.</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later license. See <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LICENSE</a> for more details.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>Minimum Requirements</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WordPress 6.0 or newer</li>\n<li>PHP 7.3 or newer (recommended)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Installation</h4>\n<h4>Direct from the Dashboard</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to WP Admin Dashboard &gt; Plugins &gt; Add New</li>\n<li>Search for &#8220;Vidplex&#8221;</li>\n<li>Click Install Now, and then activate the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20is%20vidplex%3F'>\nWhat is Vidplex?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Vidplex is a video gallery plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%20or%20ask%20questions%3F'>\nWhere can I get support or ask questions?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Stuck? Post your query in our <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/vidplex/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum</a></p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20vidplex%20for%20free%3F'>\nIs Vidplex for Free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it&#8217;s free.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20do%20i%20report%20security%20bugs%3F'>\nWhere do I report security bugs?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can report any security bugs found in the source code of this plugin through the <a href=\"https://patchstack.com/database/vdp/vidplex\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Patchstack Vulnerability Disclosure Program</a>. The Patchstack team will assist you with verification, CVE assignment and take care of notifying the developers of this plugin.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0 &#8211; Sep 18, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create a stunning video gallery with ease! Showcase YouTube videos in responsive layouts that fit any website style.",
    "description": "<p>Vidplex is a powerful and lightweight WordPress block plugin designed to display YouTube videos in a stylish and responsive gallery layout. Whether you&#8217;re a content creator, marketer, or blogger, this plugin makes it easy to showcase YouTube videos directly in your posts and pages using the Gutenberg editor.</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later license. See <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">LICENSE</a> for more details.</p>\n",
